# Fixed (not randomly generated) demo account user_ids — both the 4 demo newcomers AND
# the 4 demo mentors (B-4 added mentor-side demo login too, and /report/generate is
# also OpenAI-backed and mentor-shared). scripts/seed_demo.py must insert these exact
# 8 values as the demo User.user_id rows, not auto-generated UUIDs, so this file and
# the seed script never drift out of sync (guidelines 5-9 item 6, 6-6).
#
# Only these 8 accounts need fixed ids — each company's "extra" newcomers (added so
# the mentor demo account shows multiple assigned newcomers, guidelines 1-8/6-6) are
# never logged into directly by a shared demo login, so they're seeded with ordinary
# random UUIDs like a real registration and don't belong in this list.
DEMO_USER_IDS=demo-newcomer-a,demo-newcomer-b,demo-newcomer-c,demo-newcomer-d,demo-mentor-a,demo-mentor-b,demo-mentor-c,demo-mentor-d
